    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`startioQA` is the quality-assurance environment module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for QA configuration and server composition. Server-specific runtime settings belong in child server modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "QA changes should support validation and test coverage without drifting into framework or production defaults."
    }
